  <tei:text>
    <tei:body>
      <tei:div facs="https://archive.org/download/mahzor-lyom-rishon-shel-rosh-hashanah-day-one-jenny-marmorstein-1965/page/n84.jpg">
        <tei:p><tei:milestone unit="chapter" n="149" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:bible:psalms/149"/><tei:milestone unit="verse" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:bible:psalms/149/1" n="1"/>Halleluyah. Sing unto the Lord a new song, His fame is in the gathering of the pious. <tei:milestone unit="verse" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:bible:psalms/149/2" n="2"/>Israel rejoices in its Maker, the sons of Zion exult in their King. <tei:milestone unit="verse" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:bible:psalms/149/3" n="3"/>Let them praise His Name with dancing, with timbrel and harp let them play to Him. <tei:milestone unit="verse" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:bible:psalms/149/4" n="4"/>For the Lord favours His people, He adorns the humble with victory. <tei:milestone unit="verse" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:bible:psalms/149/5" n="5"/>The pious revel in honour, they exult upon their couches. <tei:milestone unit="verse" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:bible:psalms/149/6" n="6"/>Exaltations of God are in their throat and a two-edged sword in their hand, <tei:milestone unit="verse" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:bible:psalms/149/7" n="7"/>so as to carry out vengeance among the nations, chastisements among the peoples, <tei:milestone unit="verse" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:bible:psalms/149/8" n="8"/>to bind their kings in fetters and their notables in chains of iron, <tei:milestone unit="verse" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:bible:psalms/149/9" n="9"/>to execute on them the judgment that is written. He is an adornment to all His pious ones. Halleluyah. <tei:milestone unit="verse"/><tei:milestone unit="chapter"/></tei:p>
      </tei:div>
    </tei:body>
  </tei:text>
